{title: Light the Sky}
{artist: Grace VanderWaal}
{album: Perfectly Imperfect}
{key: C}
{capo: 1}

{start_of_verse}
[C]Stars, they got nothin' on us,
[C]I don't think you understand,
[C]Let's go out and do something we never do,[F]
[C]Cause I feel like I can do anything [G]when,
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse label="Pre-Chorus"}
[C]My head is spinning and my feet off the ground,
[F]And I can't stop dancing like no ones around,
[C]And yeah, I think we were born to [G]shine,
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[F]Stars are dull when they're compared to, [C]you and [G]I,
[F]And if people don't like it then they can, [C]close their [G]eyes,
[F]Cause we're not the same, and we don't have to [C]try,[G]
[F]Cause We're brighter than fireflies we're gonna [G]light the [C]sky
[F]Ooh oh oh,
[C]Ooh oh oh [G]oh,
[F]Ooh oh oh,
[C]Ooh oh oh [G]oh
[C]Light the sky
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse}
[C]You and me, we stand out of the [F]crowd
[C]Cause we are not afraid to let our light [G]out
[C]So trust in me and just have no [F]doubt
[C]Cause we will be tearing through the [G]clouds
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse label="Pre-Chorus"}
[C]My head is spinning and my feet off the ground,
[F]And I can't stop dancing like no ones around,
[C]And yeah, I think we were born to [G]shine,
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[F]Stars are dull when they're compared to, [C]you and [G]I,
[F]And if people don't like it then they can, [C]close their [G]eyes,
[F]Cause we're not the same, and we don't have to [C]try,[G]
[F]We're brighter than fireflies we're gonna [G]light the [C]sky
[F]Ooh oh oh,
[C]Ooh oh oh [G]oh,
[F]Ooh oh oh,
[C]Ooh oh oh [G]oh
[C]Light the sky
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[C]You and me, me and [F]you,
[C]We we will, shine [G]through,
[C]You and me, me and [F]you,
[C]We we will, [G]shine
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse label="Pre-Chorus"}
Cause my [C]head is spinning and my feet off the ground,
